[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0010","text":"（糟糕\n　忘东西了）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0020","text":"辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0030","text":"……！？\n千雪……！辛、辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0040","text":"……？　那个……我忘了东西\n所以回来拿一下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0050","text":"不行……吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0060","text":"不、不是\n也不是不行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0070","text":"……我吃了\n含大蒜的东西。所以，那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0080","text":"……\n呵呵，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0090","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_04_0100","text":"换作是我\n我也完全会吃的哦。含大蒜的东西♪"}]
